t compute loss on averaged logits.", "training_evaluation": "Replace linear scheduler with cosine annealing scheduler with linear warmup for 10% of steps, decay to min_lr=1e-6. Train using Multi-Sample Dropout (forward pass multiple times per batch to compute loss). Monitor validation loss with clipping as before. Save best model based on validation log loss. All other training parameters (epochs, batch size, mixed precision) remain unchanged."}, "parse_success": true, "raw_response": "{
