lds, compute out-of-fold validation log loss. For the test set, average predictions across all folds and models. Use early stopping on validation log loss within each model to prevent overfitting. Replace the neural training loop entirely: no GPU needed, all CPU-based. Save submission as before. This change aligns with historical experiments where LightGBM with cross-validation outperformed deep learning on this dataset."}, "parse_success": true, "raw_response": "{
